    defined-by answer
    role localized_response_template
    precondition "the diagnostic search found no fetched source addressing the exact error"
    effect "no candidate fix is retained and the gap is reported as an unresolved need"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "The diagnostic search found no fetched source that addresses this exact error."
    grounding "data/seed/multilingual-responses-repair.lino"
